docs/controller-document-contract.md:3:**Proposed v1 — not implemented.** The Document Agent will extract policy schedules, terms, invoices and veterinary records into reviewable facts and page citations. A successful Gemini PDF access probe is recorded in [Model allocation](MODEL_ALLOCATION.md); it does not establish an upload pipeline. Current `/knowledge/search` accepts only the fixed demo corpus.
